  <Docs>
    <summary>Carries an interrupted decode and the decision to accept its partial image.</summary>
    <remarks><para>The handler's final <see cref="P:Android.Graphics.ImageDecoder.PartialImageEventArgs.Handled" /> value becomes the listener's return value. True permits a partial image; false makes the decoder throw the supplied exception.</para></remarks>
